          Component {
            Type          ConfigurableSubsystem
            Name          "LS2"
            Show          on
            Position      [675, 340]
            Direction     up
            Flipped       off
            LabelPosition east
            Frame         [-20, -20; 20, 20]
            SampleTime    "-1"
            CodeGenDiscretizationMethod "2"
            CodeGenTarget "Generic"
            MaskType      "MOSFET"
            MaskDescription "Power MOSFET with selectable model depth (Switch.Config"
"):\n"
"1 - Real SW: MOSFET with thermal description (Switch.therm_mosfet), Coss (Pas"
"sives/C, Switch.Coss) and body diode (Switches/D, Switch.therm_body_diode).\n"
"2 - Ideal SW.\n"
"3 - Physical Equivalent Circuit: gate driver (Drv), package Lg/Ld/Ls/Lcs/Lk ("
"Pkg), Rg_int, nonlinear Cgs/Cgd/Cds from Ciss/Coss/Crss (Cap), temperature de"
"pendent channel (Ch), avalanche (Aval), leakage (Leak), body diode (Switches/"
"D, Switch.therm_body_diode), losses from v*i into a Cauer chain (Th). Use a s"
"tiff variable-step solver (RADAU) for configuration 3."
            MaskDisplay   "line([0, 0, -10], [20, 10, 10])\n"
"line([0, 0, -10], [10, 0, 0])\n"
"line([0, 0, -10], [-20, -10, -10])\n"
"line([-10, -10], [13, 7])\n"
"line([-10, -10], [3, -3])\n"
"line([-10, -10], [-7, -13])\n"
"line([-15, -15], [10, -10])\n"
"line([-15, -20], [0, 0])\n"
"line([-4, -8, -4], [2, 0, -2])\n"
"line([12, 12, 0], [6, 14, 14])\n"
"line([5, 19], [-6, -6])\n"
"line([0, 12, 12], [-14, -14, -6])\n"
"line([12, 19, 5, 12], [-6, 6, 6, -6])"
            MaskIconFrame off
            MaskIconOpaque off
            MaskIconRotates on
            MaskInit      "%TR_therm =  strcat('file:',Switch.Transistor.thermal_par"
"ams);\n"
"%BD_therm =  strcat('file:',Switch.BodyDiode.thermal_params );"
